   "title": "Introduction /　前書き",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "It was a peaceful day when Knight Alice should have a rest, yet she found the castle weirdly empty, so she went on to investigate. It was then the mysterious cult Ticklishism appeared, whose ritual to their Goddess was tickling?<br />\n<br />\nThis is a story about Alice the Knight ...<br />\n<br />\n平和な日、ゆっくり休んでいたはずのアリスは、城に人がいないことに気づき、調査を始める。そして突然、謎のテッコリス教団が現れ、神に捧げる儀式とはなんとくすぐりなのか?<br />\n<br />\nこれは騎士アリスの物語です"
    }
   ]
  },
